  {
    "question_id": "Q6.10",
    "class": 10,
    "subject": "Geography",
    "chapter_number": 6,
    "chapter_name": "Manufacturing Industries",
    "question_type": "conceptual",
    "question_text": "How are integrated steel plants different from mini steel plants? What problems does the industry face? What recent developments have led to a rise in the production capacity?",
    "question_latex": null,
    "mcq_options": [],
    "correct_option": null,
    "question_image": {
      "present": false,
      "description": null,
      "cloudinary_url": null,
      "latex_extracted": null,
      "source_page_number": null,
      "source_image_index": null,
      "ownership": "unknown"
    },
    "parts": [],
    "answer_text": "Integrated Steel Plants are large plants which handle everything in one complex – from putting together raw material to steel making, rolling and shaping. Mini Steel Plants are smaller, have electric arc furnaces, use mainly steel scrap and sponge iron as inputs. They have re-rollers that use steel ingots as well. They produce mild and alloy steel of given specifications. Problems of the steel industry include high costs and limited availability of coking coal, lower productivity of labour, irregular supply of power, and poor infrastructure. Recent developments that have led to a rise in production capacity include liberalisation, foreign direct investments (FDI) with the efforts of private entrepreneurs, and improvement in production processes by the use of newer technologies.",
    "answer_latex": null,
    "steps": [],
    "final_answer": "Thus, integrated steel plants are comprehensive facilities, while mini steel plants are smaller and more specialized, facing various challenges but benefiting from recent advancements.",
    "answer_image": {
      "present": false,
      "description": null,
      "cloudinary_url": null,
      "latex_extracted": null,
      "source_page_number": null,
      "source_image_index": null,
      "ownership": "unknown"
    },
    "difficulty_rating": 3,
    "difficulty_reasoning": "Requires understanding of industrial processes and recent developments in the steel industry.",
