    },
    "parts": [],
    "answer_text": "To minimize environmental degradation, industries should treat effluents at all levels, minimize water use through recycling, harvest rainwater, regulate groundwater usage, fit smoke stacks with pollution control devices, and reduce noise pollution through machinery redesign and soundproofing.",
